#. type: Title #
#: docs/features/diary.md:1 docs/features/diary.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Diary"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:8
msgid ""
"Structured diary for users and Agents, based on the [Unified Entity Model]"
"(../concepts/entity-model.md) `diary_entry` component."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/diary.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "vs memory system"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Capability | Diary                             | Autobiographical memory                    |\n"
"| ---------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Source     | User / Agent **writes actively**  | **Extracted** from dialogue in light sleep |\n"
"| Storage    | `entities` + `diary_entry`        | `autobiographical_memory` table            |\n"
"| Editing    | Update and delete allowed         | append-only                                |\n"
"| Namespace  | subject **default private world** | Digital-life memory pipeline               |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/diary.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "User / Agent isolation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:23
msgid ""
"User and Agent diaries live in the **default private world** of subjects "
"resolved from `config.yaml` **`worlds.user_subject_id` / "
"`agent_subject_id`** (boot-time `ResolvedWorldContext`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:23
msgid ""
"Shell header **User / Agent** toggle selects which subject's diary to view "
"(see [`entity-model.md`](../concepts/entity-model.md) global Subject scope)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:23
msgid ""
"Agent LLM tools (ToolSet `diary`) always write to **Agent** private world."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/diary.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Agent tools (ToolSet `diary`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:27
msgid ""
"Load via `toolset_load` with `diary`. Agent tools locate entries by **`date` "
"(YYYY-MM-DD)**; **default today** (CST noon `…T12:00:00+08:00`); **no "
"`diary_create`** — use `diary_append` (creates empty shell for the day if "
"missing, then appends)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool           | Description                                                                                     |\n"
"| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `diary_append` | Append body for date (`\\n\\n` separator); create shell if missing; `tags` only on shell creation |\n"
"| `diary_update` | Replace full entry or fields by date (not append)                                               |\n"
"| `diary_get`    | Read entry for date; error if not found                                                         |\n"
"| `diary_delete` | Delete entry for date; returns `{ ok, action, date }`                                           |\n"
"| `diary_list`   | List / date filter (unchanged)                                                                  |\n"
"| `diary_search` | Hybrid search (unchanged)                                                                       |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "**vs SAP/UI**: Shell `/diary` and human editing use SAP `diary.create` / `diary.patch` etc., located by entity **`id`**; Agent ToolSet is LLM-only and uses **`date`** uniformly.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/diary.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "SAP methods"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:42
msgid "UI satellite `@freeanima/satellite-diary` (`/diary`) calls SAP:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:44
msgid ""
"`diary.list` / `diary.create` / `diary.append` / `diary.patch` / "
"`diary.delete` / `diary.get` / `diary.search`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:46
msgid "All methods require `subject_kind: user | agent`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/diary.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data shape"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:50
msgid "`diary_entry` body:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:53
msgid ""
"`entry_at` — ISO 8601, when the diary entry occurred (**unique per day** per "
"subject private world)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:53
msgid "`tags` — optional tags"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:54
msgid ""
"Title, summary, body use entity columns `title` / `summary` / `content`."
msgstr ""
